LRC endpoint-pressure formalization (codex-2026-06-01 S503)
============================================================================
FINITE OWNER-GRAPH LEMMA
Every loopless finite digraph with indegree >= 1 at each vertex has a directed cycle.
  n   digraphs  min-in>=1 acyclic among them
  1          1          0                  0
  2          4          1                  0
  3         64         27                  0
  4       4096       2401                  0

PROTECTOR SELECTOR MODEL
Each active owner chooses one strict protector owner different from itself.
This functional subgraph is the minimal shadow of an endpoint core.
owners    selectors  acyclic selectors
     2            1                  0
     3            8                  0
     4           81                  0
     5         1024                  0
     6        15625                  0
     7       279936                  0
